ke berryessa libra  about the only correlation is that the  fourth attack which we've yet to discuss  also took place during libra  so what about the moon  the second and third murders took place  during waning gibbous moons  but the first took place under a waxing  crescent one finally the first two  killings transpired on the cusp between  friday and saturday and lake berryessa  took place on a saturday  that might have had some arcane  significance to the zodiac or it might  simply have been because he worked  during the week  and after all finding isolated couples  would be a lot easier on friday or  saturday nights than any other  the only definite common features of the  first three murders were physical  location and choice of victims  if there was a ritual it was a rough and  evolving one  in the first two attacks zodiac used a  handgun though different calibers  in the third at lake berryessa he used a  knife to assail his victims even though  he carried a gun  he also made a point of noting that  killing had been carried out by knife  we'll discuss the possible significance  of that further along  another twist in the lake berry essay  attack was that he used a costume  emblazoned with a cross circle  was this ritual attire or did he just  don the getup because a daylight attack  required a better disguise  now let's take a look at the fourth  attack on october 11 1969  beyond the fact that it took place late  on a saturday night just two weeks after  the lake berryessa attack it bears  almost no similarity to the others  the victim was paul stein a 29 year old  lone male cab driver  the location was san francisco's  presidio heights district not some  isolated rural spot  it wasn't close to the water and stein  was dispatched with a single shot to his  head  this was no frenzied assault  if zodiac hadn't torn off part of  stein's bloody shirt and sent pieces of  it to newspapers and police  probably no one would ever have  connected him to the crime  so did zodiac just abandon his  established pattern  or is there something else involved  my guess is that stein's murder wasn't  planned it smacks more of a killing of  opportunity or of necessity  stein's last communication with his  dispatcher just minutes before he was  slain  said that he was taking a fair to the  intersection of washington and maple  streets  instead they ended up a block away at  washington and cherry  simple confusion may have led to an  altercation that ended with zodiac  shooting stein  on a public street in full view of  witnesses  most damningly this time zodiac left  bloody fingerprints all over the cab  incriminating evidence of the first  degree  to me this attests to a monumental  screw-up not masterful design  from this point on zodiac can't be  definitely linked to any other murders  in the aftermath of stein's killing  zodiac shifted to making unfulfilled  threats against school children  but he also continued to boast of more  murders and more slaves though he never  mentioned who where or when  did the stein fiasco make him more  careful  or did he just lose his nerve  in october 1970 san francisco chronicle  reporter paul avery received a strange  halloween card  the front side featured a smiling  skeleton and the caption from your  secret pal  lower down the message continued  i feel it in my bones you ache to know  my name and so i'll clue you in  inside however the card read but why  spoil the game  more interesting was what zodiac wrote  on the back  there he misspelled the word paradise  which was printed vertically down the  middle of the card  the word slaves was written horizontally  across it  just like zodiac's crossed circle this  divided the back side of the card into  four quarters  in those he wrote by fire by gun by  knife by rope  recall that zodiac had earlier made a  special point of noting a killing by  knife  and he's also killed by gun  was he now using fire and rope to  dispatch his victims  he also warned that his new killings  would look like accidents or suicides  or was zodiac just toying with press and  police  in any case the halloween card also  boasted a haul of 14 afterlife slaves  however zodiac wasn't being original  it turns out that his four means of  death fire gun knife and rope are the  clearly featured elements of a death  wheel on the front cover of a western  comic book published in 1952  tim holt number 30.  inside it the complete death wheel is  shown to have 12 sections in other words  it's a death zodiac  legend has it the comic states that the  wheel was made for king solomon the  ruler of the gin  borrowing from a comic doesn't prove an  occult connection  but maybe it does show  that zodiac was an old comics fan  however the death wheel is also  reminiscent of zodiac's emblematic  crossed circle  so that deserves closer attention  to the casual viewer it might look like  a simple crosshairs  but it's much more and has a long  history in occult symbolism  and many meanings  the four parts of the circle can stand  for the four elements earth fire air and  water  the four directions north south east and  west  or the four seasons winter spring summer  and fall or even the four letters of the  name of god y h  w h  the four seasons of course are closely  related to what else the zodiac  a term that means wheel or circle of  animals  the cross circle is also known as the  celtic cross or odin's cross and today  has been widely embraced as a symbol by  white nationalists and neo-pagans  but zodiac's only apparent use of the  cross circle wasn't to chart the  movements of the heavens but to indicate  places on the ground  places connected to his past and future  attacks  or maybe it was just another mind game  to send people on wild goose chases  most notably on june 26 1970  zodiac mailed the san francisco  chronicle another letter along with a  gas station road map of california  on it he drawn a cross circle over mount  diablo a prominent geographic feature  about 35 miles east of the city  included were instructions that the zero  or top point of the circle be aligned to  magnetic north  a 32 character coded clue accompanied  the map  it supposedly gave directions to a bomb  he'd planted to blow up a school bus  a follow-up letter stated that the clues  involved radians and number of inches  along the radians  the mention of radians suggests a  passing familiarity with higher  mathematics  later some imaginative theorists argued  that meant zodiac had a connection to  unibomber ted kaczynski  but there's nothing else in the manner  or motives of the two men's crimes to  support a tie  other theorists argue that the mount  diablo radiance business showed how  zodiac used magnetic lines of force to  pick the spots for his crimes  well maybe but none of it adds up to  anything solid  the real question might be why mount  diablo  the peak is notable for two things first  it's the starting point for the land  survey system covering most of northern  and central california  it's literally at the center or the  crosshairs of the region's north-south  east-west grid so was zodiac familiar  with surveying  mount diablo is also known for something  else and that brings us back to the  occult angle  the name diablo or devil comes from the  spanish who allegedly got the notion  from the bulgones native americans  according to the story the bolgones held  the peak to be the home of a powerful  evil spirit or pui  that's led some modern cultists to imbue  the mountain with superstitious awe and  significance  was zodiac one of them  or was he at least aware of the  mountain's sinister reputation  that brings us to the larger context i  wanted to explore  zodiac's place among the many serial  killings and unsolved murders that  plagued the san francisco bay area and  other parts of the golden state in the  late 60s and early 70s  i see the zodiac killings as part of a  dark aftermath to 1967's summer of love  when san francisco reigned as capital of  the counter culture and visions of peace  love and understanding shimmered in a  haze of acid flashbacks  but alongside all this psychedelic  grooviness arose a baffling wave of  violence  1969 not only witnessed the zodiac but  also the murderous manson family and the  fatal stabbing of a young man by a  member of the hell's angels motorcycle  gang at the altamonte music festival  a killing carried out while the rolling  stones perform sympathy for the devil on  stage  irony  or ritual  hidden in plain sight  and that wasn't all  the bay area scene transformed into a  hunting ground for cereal and macabre  killers  there was 21 year old edmund kemper who  in late 1969  was released from the atascadero state  hospital after serving five years for  murdering his grandparents  in may 1972 he began abducting and  slaughtering young female hitchhikers  usually in pairs gaining the nickname  co-ed killer  he finally turned himself in after  killing his mother  during the same time the remains of  another seven young women and maybe as  many as 14 were found dumped along  roadways near santa rosa to the north  the so-called hitchhiker killer was  never caught  and this was very near zodiac territory  could some of them  have been his claimed victims  on the more occult end of the spectrum  there was the october 1974 ritualistic  murder in stanford university's memorial  church of 19 year old newlywed  arliss perry  and then there was the professed  satanist and cannibal stanley dean baker  in july 1970 police arrested baker and a  male companion south of big sur after a  hit and run accident  baker was 22 and looked like a typical  hippie except for the satanic bible he  carried  and the human finger bones in his  pockets  these he explained belonged to a montana  social worker who'd made the fatal  mistake of giving him a lift  after killing the vehicle's driver with  a 22 pistol a weapon also used by zodiac  baker ritually ate the man's heart and  stole his car  the fingers he took along for snacks  and there's more to baker's story  he claimed to have been introduced to  satanism and cannibalism when he joined  a blood drinking cult in colorado or  wyoming  he claimed to have been a member of a  cult called  four pie which purportedly carried out  human sacrifices disguised as random  murders  at its head said a mysterious leader  dubbed the gran chinggon  you can consult a spanish slang  dictionary to get the full meaning of  that name  baker also confessed to having murdered  a san francisco interior designer by the  name of robert salem  before leaving the scene baker wrote  zodiac on the wall  now since baker was in prison or  elsewhere when zodiac committed his  murders the two men couldn't be one in  the same  but could they have had a common  inspiration  it's at least worth noting that in 1966  shortly before zodiac began his rampage  the church of satan opened its doors in  san francisco  around the same time so did the  ominously named process church of the  final judgment  it was an offshoot of scientology that  among many other options  allowed his followers to worship satan  and wallow in a morass of violence  more interesting perhaps the process  church also had a swastika-like symbol  composed of four peas  just like baker's alleged murder cult  but if zodiac was a devil worshiper  you'd expect more hail satan's instead  of cross circles  also in comparing cannibal killer baker  in the zodiac it's worth noting that  baker once lived in colorado and did  prison time in montana  the survivor of the lake berryessa  attack david hartnell recalled zodiac  saying he had escaped from a prison in  montana or colorado  coincidence  probably  but as with so many other things in the  zodiac case you just never know for sure  zodiac was an enigma wrapped in a riddle  it's his mystery that accounts for our  continuing fascination with his crimes  and part of that mystery involves  tantalizing hints but no real proof that  he was involved with the occult  there's only one thing i can absolutely  assure you of  i'm not the zodiac  you
 

